bbcode_enabled = true
bbcode_text = "[center][b]Hi everyone, 
We are back with some more adjustments!!
Have fun :)

- Doro and Mario
[/b][/center]

[b]Balancing[/b]
[center][b]Neutral[/b][/center]
o Vampiric Armor: Vampirism 4 -> 5
o Gold Armor: Block 30 -> 25
o Boiling Pot: Speed bonus 30% -> 50%
o Artifact Stone: Death: Cooldown 1.7s -> 1.5s
o Spicy Banana: Heat chance 55% -> 65%
o Stankus’ Toothpick: Speed per food 10% -> 12%

[center][b]Multiclass[/b][/center]
o Death Lotus: Mana 3 -> 4
o Hogus Bogus: Stamina usage maximum 6 -> 8. Buffs per stamina 4 -> 3
o Spin to Win: Cooldown 3.6s -> 3.8s
o Thermal Thorns: Spikes 3 -> 5

[center][b]Ranger[/b][/center]
o Yggdrasil Leaf: Heal 15 -> 18
o Piercing Arrow: Luck chance 35% -> 40%
o White Lily Collar: Activation chance 25% -> 22%
o Blue Sage Collar: Activation chance 6% -> 7%

[center][b]Reaper[/b][/center]
o Relic Case: Cooldown 2.5s -> 2.3s
o Dark Ritual: Speed per darkness item 25% -> 35%
o War Scythe: Damage +2

[center][b]Pyromancer[/b][/center]
o Dragon Nest: Mana 6 -> 8, heal 7 -> 8
o Molten Greatsword: Fire item count 8 -> 10

[center][b]Berserker[/b][/center]
o Tiger Rune (Inventory): Duplication chance 12% -> 11%
o Tiger Rune (Armor): Block 4 -> 5
o Shaman Mask: Cooldown 3.6s -> 3.8s
o Chain Whip: Heal 12 -> 15
o Busted Blade: Cooldown during battle rage 3s -> 2.5s. Damage -10
o Spiked Staff: Spikes 4 -> 5

[center][b]Mage[/b][/center]
o Mage Hat: Mana 3 -> 4
o Devouring Sphere: Cooldown 1.5s -> 1.4s
o Badger Spirit Companion: Cooldown 4.8s -> 5.0s
o Cat Spirit Companion: 2.7s -> 2.4s
o Chess Master: Trigger speed 35% -> 40%
o Cupdrake: Trigger speed per food 10% -> 15%
o Wand of Dissonance: Cooldown 3.1s -> 2.9s

[center][b]Adventurer[/b][/center]
o Dragon Knight: Heal 10 -> 8
o Hero Shield: Damage bonus 1 -> 2
o Fedora: Cooldown 2.5s -> 2.8s. Treasure chance 65% -> 60%
o Turtle: Block 50 -> 60
o Scissorswords: Damage +4

[center][b]Engineer[/b][/center]
o Lightning Staff: Stamina cost 0.7 -> 0.8
o Magitecc Armor: Block gained 35 -> 30
o Thor’s Hammer: Stun chance 45% -> 50%. Accuracy 85% -> 90%
o Gold Cube: Base heal 40 -> 30
o Bismuth Cube: Advance limit 12 -> 10
o Generator: Stamina cost 1.0 -> 0.8. Cooldown 5s -> 4.5s
o Eat-o-matic: Other food bonus 65% -> 75%
o Electric Torch: Speed Bonus 35% ->40%
o Mecha Bat: Lifesteal 20% -> 22%
o Perpetuum Mobile: Refund 32% -> 30%"
text = "Hi everyone, 
We are back with some more adjustments!!
Have fun :)

- Doro and Mario


Balancing
Neutral
o Vampiric Armor: Vampirism 4 -> 5
o Gold Armor: Block 30 -> 25
o Boiling Pot: Speed bonus 30% -> 50%
o Artifact Stone: Death: Cooldown 1.7s -> 1.5s
o Spicy Banana: Heat chance 55% -> 65%
o Stankus’ Toothpick: Speed per food 10% -> 12%

Multiclass
o Death Lotus: Mana 3 -> 4
