o Thermal Thorns: Spikes 3 -> 5

Ranger
o Yggdrasil Leaf: Heal 15 -> 18
o Piercing Arrow: Luck chance 35% -> 40%
o White Lily Collar: Activation chance 25% -> 22%
o Blue Sage Collar: Activation chance 6% -> 7%

Reaper
o Relic Case: Cooldown 2.5s -> 2.3s
o Dark Ritual: Speed per darkness item 25% -> 35%
o War Scythe: Damage +2

Pyromancer
o Dragon Nest: Mana 6 -> 8, heal 7 -> 8
o Molten Greatsword: Fire item count 8 -> 10

