o Chain Whip: Heal 12 -> 15
o Busted Blade: Cooldown during battle rage 3s -> 2.5s. Damage -10
o Spiked Staff: Spikes 4 -> 5

Mage
o Mage Hat: Mana 3 -> 4
o Devouring Sphere: Cooldown 1.5s -> 1.4s
o Badger Spirit Companion: Cooldown 4.8s -> 5.0s
o Cat Spirit Companion: 2.7s -> 2.4s
o Chess Master: Trigger speed 35% -> 40%
o Cupdrake: Trigger speed per food 10% -> 15%
